Follow the Dom Kirby Creative brand kit. Read `AGENTS.md` and `.specify/memory/constitution.md` (installed projects: under `dkc-brand/`).

- Use tokens, never raw values: `tokens/tokens.css`, `tokens/tailwind-theme.css` or `tokens/tokens.ts`.
- `color.green` is a fill only; green text is `color.green-deep`; text on green is navy. `color.logo-*` is logo-only.
- Poppins headings/numerals/prices, Raleway everything else, named text styles only.
- No shadows, gradients, emoji or exclamation marks. Prices in full with units.
- Logos only from `assets/logos/`. WCAG 2.2 AA with visible focus states.
